Marzo is a figure of the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]] who founds a city in every cycle and calls it [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Fat Cock City|Fat Cock City]]. It has moved and its people have moved with it, but it has always been his. He keeps to the ziggurat in the blood lake at the city's heart, working from a nexus of power there, and the Weft call him Marzu.

He can reach the warden of [[Geography/Althane/The Thirteenth Realm|the Thirteenth Realm]]: he strums a guitar into an amplifier and the sound carries up into the black void where the warden shows itself. He spoke once to the Nightmare Heart, and he keeps a carnival beacon.
